Vampire is an open remort class. It is a permanent supernatural nature, not a
guild, and composes with your guild. A character may have only one class.
Remort level 1 characters may find the First Grave below Stoker's church and
type |GKBattune shrine|000 to accept the Embrace.

The First Grave is the public threshold to the Crimson Covenant. After the
Embrace, descend into its safe sanctuary: gather in the Crimson Hall, bind a
coffin in the Vault of Sealed Earth, and work Blood Sorcery in the Red Chapel.
The sanctuary supplies no free blood and bypasses none of the class's limits.

The class revolves around Vitae, Hunger, prey selection, prepared discipline
loadouts, and regional Exposure. Vitae does not regenerate or decay. Feeding
restores it; discipline powers spend it. Hunger is derived from the remaining
Vitae: Sated, Stirring, Ravenous, or Frenzy.

